		{"id":"ppj-exec-summary","type":"text","text":"ADMIN_ExpenseManagement_v1.1.0\n\nDomain:\nAdministration\n\nLifecycle:\nActive / Requirement Refinement / UAT Preparation\n\nProgress:\n~90% (2026-09-15 meeting recap)\n\nGate:\nMulti-traveler request model, end-to-end lifecycle and UAT preparation\n\nOutcome:\nStandardize Administration business-travel and expense-management workflows: Request -> Approval -> Business Trip -> Advance -> Expense -> Settlement.\n\nTop Blocker:\nScope creep beyond Request -> Approval -> Trip -> Expense -> Settlement\n\nNext Milestone:\nValidate the booking workflow and status model\n\nLast Verified:\n2026-09-18","x":0,"y":-90,"width":760,"height":560,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ppj-management-attention","type":"text","text":"KEY MANAGEMENT ATTENTION\n\nTop Risks\n- Scope creep beyond Request -> Approval -> Trip -> Expense -> Settlement\n- Approval/status rules need confirmation\n- Multi-traveler data model complexity\n\nDecisions Needed\n- None recorded\n\nExternal Dependencies\n- None recorded","x":810,"y":-90,"width":500,"height":560,"color":"1"},
